e spiritual drink; for they drank from the spiritual rock that accompanied them, and that rock was Christ.","from":6},{"book":"NUM","chapter":20,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":16,"source":"openbible","text":"So Moses took the staff from the LORDʼs presence, just as he had been commanded.","from":6},{"book":"NUM","chapter":20,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":16,"source":"openbible","text":"Then Moses raised his hand and struck the rock twice with his staff, so that a great amount of water gushed out, and the congregation and their livestock were able to drink.","from":6},{"book":"NEH","chapter":9,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":15,"source":"both","text":"In their hunger You gave them bread from heaven; in their thirst You brought them water from the rock. You told them to go in and possess the land that You had sworn to give them.","from":6},{"book":"DEU","chapter":8,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":14,"source":"both","text":"He led you through the vast and terrifying wilderness with its venomous snakes and scorpions, a thirsty and waterless land. He brought you water from the rock of flint.","from":6},{"book":"PSA","chapter":105,"verse":41,"verseEnd":41,"votes":13,"source":"both","text":"He opened a rock, and water gushed out; it flowed like a river in the desert.","from":6},{"book":"PSA","chapter":78,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":12,"source":"openbible","text":"He split the rocks in the wilderness and gave them drink as abundant as the seas.","from":6},{"book":"PSA","chapter":78,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":12,"source":"openbible","text":"He brought streams from the stone and made water flow down like rivers.","from":6}],"notes":[{"id":"exod-17-rock","title":"The rock that followed them","kind":"type"}],"groups":[]},"8-13":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":4,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"joshua-h3091g","na